<title>SPAIN: Spain 6-mo T-bill yield falls to low at 5.865 pct.</title>
<headline>Spain 6-mo T-bill yield falls to low at 5.865 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-01-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Spain announced the following results at today's Treasury debt auction (amounts bid, allocated in billions of pesetas):</p>
<p>ISSUE	Yield    Pvs     Price     Pvs	Bid    Allocated</p>
<p>6-month    5.865   5.949    97.120   97.080  301.865  122.582</p>
</text>
